4. Software dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Lacuna builds on the scientific Python ecosystem. Runtime dependencies
(nibabel, numpy, scipy, nilearn, pandas, pooch, h5py, tqdm, joblib,
nitransforms, pyyaml, requests) are each distributed under their own
permissive open-source licenses (BSD-3-Clause, MIT, Apache-2.0, or similar).
Refer to each project's distribution for the authoritative license text.
